MV
==

Move or rename files.


BASIC
-----
mv old.txt new.txt

Renames file.


MOVE FILE
---------
mv file.txt folder/

Moves file into folder.


MOVE FOLDER
-----------
mv old-name new-name

Renames folder.


MOVE MULTIPLE
-------------
mv file1.txt file2.txt folder/

Moves both files into folder.


WHAT IT DOES
------------
• Original is removed
• File goes to new location
• Same as cut-paste


ERRORS
------
"no such file"      → File doesn't exist
"permission denied" → No write access
